## 3. Testing the App Without Internet Connection

I turned off the internet connection in the emulator and tested a feature that required network access.

For example, when trying to log in or fetch online data:

**Observed Behavior:**

* The app was unable to connect to the server.
* A network-related error or loading failure was displayed.
* The app did not crash.
* After enabling the internet connection again, the network feature worked normally.

### Example Test Result

| Test Case             | Expected Result                          | Observed Result |
| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------- |
| Internet ON           | Data/login should work                   | Pass            |
| Internet OFF          | App should show a proper error message   | Pass            |
| Turn internet back ON | App should reconnect or work after retry | Pass            |

**Conclusion:** The application handled the loss of internet connection properly and did not crash.

